n't want to burn out again  honestly I've got so many big exciting  personal and professional goals for 2020  and I really need to just devote all of  my positive energy towards meeting them  so I want to say thank you all for all  of your amazing supportive words when I  kind of went off the grid I did read all  of your DMS I got them sent to me I read  them they really helped me keep going so  I really hope that this video has been a  bit of an inspiration for helping you to  foster a healthier relationship with  technology as you move forward into 2020  so everyone I would love to hear from  you what are your thoughts on quitting  social media  or doing a social media detox so to  speak I would love to hear if this is  long you've done before how did it feel  did it work for you did you feel  refreshed afterwards also what are you  guys thinking about doing for your near  Zoar solutions that doesn't involve  dieting I'd love to hear some ideas for  that as well so if you like this video  be sure to give it the thumbs up leave  me a comment below I want to hear from  all of you subscribe to the channel and  I will see you next time on Abby's  kitchen happy near bye  [Music]

